# https://www.toptal.com/developers/gitignore/

### Miscellaneous ###
logs/
*.log

dist/
build/
out/

tmp/
temp/
*.tmp

### Python regression checks ###
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

### dotenv ###
# Ignore dotenv files (unencrypted), allow encrypted files with .enc
.env
.env.*
!.env.enc
!.env.*.enc


### VisualStudioCode ###
.vscode/*
!.vscode/settings.json
!.vscode/tasks.json
!.vscode/launch.json
!.vscode/extensions.json
